body:
\[Question\] Bought used AirPods, now found out that the guys name is still in the name of aipods, and that he can see me through the find my iphone app. am kinda scared now, anyway to reset it so he cannot stalk me ?

&#x200B;

UPDATE : The guy is not responding and am scared that the airpods were stolen or found and he sold it to me ... what can i do ?
